From: QindaWeb contributors
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: preserve a reoffered clipboard source

GTK adds SAVE_TARGETS and submits the same wl_data_source again. Cancelling
that still-current source makes Firefox destroy it before retained clipboard
data arrives. Keep it alive while refreshing offers and retention. A different
source, or clearing the selection, still cancels the previous owner.

--- a/src/compositor/wayland_wrapper/qwldatadevice.cpp
+++ b/src/compositor/wayland_wrapper/qwldatadevice.cpp
@@ -161,7 +161,7 @@
 
     DataSource *dataSource = source ? DataSource::fromResource(source) : nullptr;
 
-    if (m_selectionSource)
+    if (m_selectionSource && m_selectionSource != dataSource)
         m_selectionSource->cancel();
 
     m_selectionSource = dataSource;
